window.products.push({"id":805093,"name":"Letraset 3-Pack ProMarker Ultra-Fine Nib","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O5f1RY7cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Letraset Ultrafine Nib add-on adds a unique third dimension to, achieve ultra-fine lines in any color. Ideal for detailed illustration work, the Ultra-fine offers smooth, 100% consistent ink flow with no clogging or dry out. Attaching the nib is quick and mess free - simply clip into place over the existing fine nib then wait a few seconds for ink to flow through. Nib can also be used with Letraset Aqua Marker, Metallic Marker and Neon Marker. Ultra-fine Nib 3 Pack includes: 3x Ultra-Fine Nibs and 3x Caps.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O5f1RY7cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Letraset","source_asin":"B007L9TN1U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805093","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007L9TN1U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007L9TN1U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":805094,"name":"Portable Air Conditioner, Evaporative Personal Air Cooler with 3 Speeds 7 Colors, Rechargeable Air Conditioner Fan for Home, Dorm, Room, Office","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":60.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pBAJPqV8L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Bring along a portable air cooler for a fresh and cool summer! Our evaporative air coolers drive away the hot air around you in seconds, providing you and your family with a cool, cleansed flow of air. With a large 16-ounce tank, you can add ice or ice water to the evaporative air cooler to improve its cooling performance.It's the best choice for summer! ☃Enjoy Cool, Clean Air, Anywhere! The powerful, compact personal air cooler that pulls warm air from the room through its evaporation water filter to fill any space with cool, clean comfortable air!  The mini desktop cooler will be your ideal partner in this summer. ☃Add Ice Water & Essential Oil You can pour the water in the tank, even ice which could make cooler wind. Maximum 300ml water of the tank can be used for around 8 hours in highest shift.  Add a drop of essential oil that you like. ☃Easy-Fill & Ultra-Quiet Simply fill with water, plug it into any standard wall outlet or USB port and enjoy! It runs up to 8 hours per fill!  The whisper-quiet fan and soothing night light make it perfect to use throughout the night for a comfortable sleep! ☃3 Levels Fan Speed The fan has 3 speed options to fit your need when you are sleeping, working or doing outside sports.  Please keep the mini air conditioner balance, don’t lean or upend to prevent water from leaking out. ☃7 Different Colors Option LED Water tank features with 7 colors LED, you can choose a variety of light colors to suit your mood. The LED lights can also be changed automatically in 7 colors. Whatever day or night, brings you freshness air at any moment. Package Includes : 1 x Air Cooler 1 x USB Power Cable 1 x Instruction guide","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pBAJPqV8L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AUBNICO","source_asin":"B0921QVLF6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805094","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0921QVLF6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0921QVLF6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
