window.products.push({"id":805097,"name":"Innovating Science Colored Premium Matte Poster (100#) Periodic Tables, 34.0\" x 21.0\" - Large Poster","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GJDwvaxLL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Innovating Science periodic tables poster is used to study the elements, and is color coded to help students distinguish between metals, non-metals, and noble gas families, and differentiate types of metals, solids, liquids, and gases from synthetic elements. The poster includes the name, symbol, atomic number, weight, mass, and electron configuration of each element for further detail, and is made of premium matte 100# paper.The poster is suitable for age 13 and older, and measures 32.0 x 21.0 inches (L x H). (L is length, the horizontal distance from left to right; H is height, the vertical distance from the lowest to highest point.) Science education products incorporate applied math and science principles into classroom and homeschool-based projects. Teachers in pre-K, elementary, and secondary classrooms use science education kits and products alongside science, technology, engineering, and math (STEM) curriculum to demonstrate STEM concepts and real-world applications through hands-on activities. Science education projects include a broad range of activities, such as practical experiments in engineering, aeronautics, robotics, energy, chemistry, physics, biology, and geology. Innovating Science products, manufactured by Aldon Corporation, include educational kits for the chemistry, life science, green chemistry, advanced placement chemistry, and forensic fields. Aldon Corporation was founded in 1964, and is headquartered in Avon, NY.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GJDwvaxLL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Innovating Science","source_asin":"B01ERXHCS8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805097","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01ERXHCS8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01ERXHCS8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":805098,"name":"Lasko 18\" Stand Fan with Cyclone Grill, Tan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qGKyPsLlL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Stay cool with this Lasko 18\" Stand Fan with Cyclone Grill Tan S18902. It is ideal for hot weather use in any area where you need air circulation. The Lasko stand fan provides quiet cooling and it has three energy-efficient speeds. It also tilts and adjusts up to 54.5\" in height so you can easily direct the air where needed. The widespread oscillation helps to maximize the cooling area. Made for ultimate out-of-the-box convenience, this item is easy to assemble without the need for tools. The pedestal fan is ideal for homes, schools, libraries, hospitals, meeting rooms and any other space where people work or spend periods of time. The portable design is also easy to move around.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qGKyPsLlL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lasko","source_asin":"B00CUX6D38","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805098","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CUX6D38","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CUX6D38","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
