window.products.push({"id":805100,"name":"Open Road Brands Be Yourself Unless You Can Be a Cowgirl Wood Wall Decor - Cowgirl Wall Art for Bedroom, Living Room or Kitchen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QJP9B9P6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Open Road Brands official product: You should've been a cowgirl, but it's not too late to embrace that wild lifestyle. This fun decor features an eye-catching turquoise background and a distressed finish for a rustic, Western look. Fun Vintage Sign: Reading, \"Be yourself, unless you can be a cowgirl. Then be a cowgirl,\" this wall decor is as eye-catching as your Stetson. Material: This lightweight sign is made of MDF wood, making it easy to display on your wall. Made in the USA. Places to Use: Hang this humorous decor on the wall of your bedroom, garage, or she shed to put your personality on display. Size: 5.5\" W X 8.25\" H X 0.5\" D","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QJP9B9P6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Open Road Brands","source_asin":"B0913H5FZ1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805100","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0913H5FZ1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0913H5FZ1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":805101,"name":"Melange Coupe 18-Piece Porcelain Dinnerware Set (Winter Fox) | Service for 6 | Microwave, Dishwasher & Oven Safe | Dinner Plate, Salad Plate & Soup Bo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Dnol5LQcL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"About Melange Melange dinnerware is all about treating you to everyday elegance. We believe fine dinner sets shouldn’t mean fragile dinner sets. We believe every meal should be complemented by dinnerware that makes you smile. That’s why we’ve used premium materials to bring on the durability, special craftsmanship to enhance the longevity, and lovely detailing to catch anyone’s eye. An Everyday Porcelain Dinner Plate Set Designed to Last and Impress Impress your guests, crown that dinner party, or upgrade your everyday dinnerware with an elegant porcelain coupe dinner set that epitomizes durability. We’ve combined high-quality porcelain with a unique chip-resistant design to create a porcelain set that you can use every single day without dealing with constant cracking, flaking, or chipping.  - Vitrified at temperatures of over 2480F.  - Microwave, oven and dishwasher safe.  - 0% porosity for greater durability.  - Complete set for service of 4 or 8.  - Elegant floral pattern and lovely glaze. Designed to Last We’ve adopted a premium approach to treat you to a dinner plate set that will serve you for years. Not only is the porcelain treated at higher temperatures to make it much stronger but the place sets have special rounded edges that keep chipping at bay, and the high-heat treated porcelain never absorbs any moisture that leads to cracking like others do. For Daily Use No dealing with fragile porcelain dinner sets that you only whip out whenever you have company. Melange dinnerware is strong enough to handle the rigors of daily use. You can safely use it in the microwave, clean it in the dishwasher without breaking, and even use it to reheat food in the oven up to 400F. Everything You Need Every set comes with a dinner plate, salad plate, soup bowl and a mug; everything you need to serve your family or guests a full course meal. Choose between our 16-piece set that comes with 4 of each piece of cutlery and serves 4, or our 32-piece dinner set that comes with 8 of each and serves 8. Understated Elegance Simple yet eye-catching, our range of designs exude an effortless elegance that blends into just about any setting. Beautifully done floral detailing meets lovely colors and a well-done glaze to create porcelain place settings with a premium feel. Get one set for yourself and a couple more as gifts and experience the magic of Melange.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Dnol5LQcL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melange","source_asin":"B074XHFFTZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805101","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074XHFFTZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074XHFFTZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
