window.products.push({"id":805202,"name":"KidKraft Avalon Wooden Children's Desk with Hutch, Chair and Storage, White, Gift for Ages 5-10, 41.75 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":229.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TPEifKpwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The KidKraft Avalon Desk with Hutch and chair would look perfect in any child’s bedroom. This desk gives kids a great place for working on homework and a perfect spot for storing pictures, trophies or other treasures. Sturdy wood construction makes this a great investment for any child’s room. From the Manufacturer Functionality and style meet in the KidKraft Large Avalon Desk in White. This stylish piece of children's furniture cast in crisp white is designed for ages 5 and up, making it a perfect homework spot. With a generous work surface and a large hutch to hold supplies, your child will love making this desk a special study spot. Unique features include:","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TPEifKpwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KidKraft","source_asin":"B08XQML3TF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805202","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XQML3TF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XQML3TF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":805203,"name":"Mayshion Stunning 4-in-1 Stainless Steel Wine Chiller Stick - Champagne Wine Chilling Rod with Wine Aerator, Pourer & Stopper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d9kyuxXCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM 4-IN-1 WINE CHILLER FOR THOSE WHO APPRECIATE FINE WINE DRINKING Keeping wines at just the right drinking temperature is a great dilemma. Too cold and it could mask the vintner's uniquely crafted complexities. Too warm and the flavors may take a back seat to the alcohol. The answer to this? Mayshion Wine Chiller. Why Mayshion Wine Chiller is A MUST? The best of its kind, Mayshion Wine Chiller is an innovative product designed to keep your white wines chilled and bring your room temperature reds down to a more suitable \"cellar\" temperature, without the need for an ice bucket. Ice buckets often make white wine too cold, masking the flavors and complexities of the wine, not to mention they are messy and bulky. With your Mayshion Wine Chiller, wines are chilled from the inside of the bottle so you can enjoy perfectly chilled wine every time. A MUST HAVE item for family/friend gathering, special occasions & gift set. Key Features & Benefits: Sleek Stainless steel chiller tube to enable optimal drinking temperature for up to 30 minutes. Perfect to chill all types of wine from inside  Design to fit all bottle sizes. Handy size and lightweight Built in aerator allows wine to breath to perfection by releasing its aromas & flavors Unique mouthful pourer for wine dripping & taste preservation BPA-Free safety stopper to prevent wine from leaking from the bottle while pouring Quality assurance: Backed by a lifetime hassle free warranty BONUS: extra stopper to keep your wine fresh ACT NOW and Chill Your Own Wine in the Comfort of Your Home Don't Wait, CLICK the \"ADD to CART\" Button and Enjoy the Art of Wine Chilling","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d9kyuxXCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mayshion","source_asin":"B00VB7796Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805203","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00VB7796Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00VB7796Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":805204,"name":"B’WELL 12 oz - Glass Travel Mug - Reusable Coffee Cup - To Go Coffee Mug - Silicone Lid & Base - Tea Travel Mug - Hot & Cold Drinks - Dishwasher & Mic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yNcxDEn2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"By using a glass reusable coffee mug you will prevent unnecessary plastic pollution and you will positively support the environment. Moreover, a reusable glass coffee cup looks way more stylish and elegant than disposable coffee cups and healthier than any other materials. Why is Borosilicate Glass better than regular glass? - Not all glass is created equally. The Borosilicate glass is thermal shock resistant - It will not become cloudy over time; the glass will be as clear as the day you bought it - It’s lighter than regular glass - The Glass will not produce condensation on the outer layer when filled with a cold beverage - It makes drinks taste better. When you use borosilicate glass the liquid inside remains pure, because borosilicate glass has low solubility, keeping your beverage contaminant free - In terms of overall performance, borosilicate glass is far superior to regular glass. Because of its durability and resistance to chemical changes, it has been traditionally used in chemistry labs as well as for kitchenware and premium glasses. Borosilicate glass is a significant upgrade from traditional glass, and because of its superior quality, it is often priced higher -For your drinking pleasure, our Double Wall Glass Cups are insulated to keep your drinks hot or cold for extended periods of time. In addition, the double wall glass structure ensures that the glass remains cool to touch! Beverages appear to float inside the inner layer of the clear glass. Moreover, the silicone lid & base are made up of 100% food-grade silicone, non-toxic and Eco-friendly with an attractive, ergonomic and practical design. An eco-friendly reusable glass cup is just one step we can take towards a smarter & more sustainable lifestyle. Replace your disposable single use cups, with the innovative B’WELL reusable travel cups! It is time to change the way you drink!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yNcxDEn2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"B'WELL","source_asin":"B077GT59RG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805204","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077GT59RG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077GT59RG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":805205,"name":"Amazing Shower Curtains - 2020 World Map Shower Curtain 70x70 by Segmia","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714iXHWdauL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2020 World Map Shower Curtain","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714iXHWdauL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazing Shower Curtains","source_asin":"B016GJXS3O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805205","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016GJXS3O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016GJXS3O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":805206,"name":"USIX 2pc Pack-Handmade Men's Lapel Pin Artificial White Calla Lily Boutonniere Pin for Suit Wedding Groom Groomsmen Brooch Rose Boutonniere (Calla Lil","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.3,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oIjHZTW8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material: Pure hand made with fabric flower, satin, ribbons Occasion: Anniversary, Cocktail party, Wedding, Prom, Formal dinner, Homecoming celebration This wristlet corsage and boutonniere are perfect for weddings, proms, quinceaneras, mother’s day speeches and other special events. Unlike fresh flowers, this artificial flower can be kept as a keepsake after the event. Tips: Originally named after the French word for the bodice of a dress to which it was attached, corsages were originally thought to be lucky or ward off evil spirits. It has become a customary practice and a demonstration of affection from a date. It is thought that originally the gentleman would bring a gift of flowers for the parents of his date, and would select one flower to give to his date which would then be carried or attached to her clothing. In some countries, corsages are worn by the mothers and grandmothers of the bride and groom at a wedding ceremony. The corsage is worn on a young woman's clothing or wrist for the homecoming celebration or other formal occasions such as prom in some schools around the world. When attending a school formal or prom, providing a corsage for a prom date signifies  consideration and generosity. Corsages are usually worn around a prom date's wrist; alternatively, it may be pinned on her dress, or a modified nosegay can be carried in her hand. The colors of the flowers are usually designed to complement the dress. Prom couples may wish to go together to choose the flowers for a custom-made corsage or boutonniere.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oIjHZTW8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"USIX","source_asin":"B081SRNH7L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805206","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081SRNH7L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081SRNH7L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
