window.products.push({"id":805222,"name":"Rosenthal Gourmet Collection 12-Ounce Tall Café Latté Cup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31STV8NGAZL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The creative cuisine surprises with modern Latin-quotations, it impresses with Japanese influences and Mediterranean taste bud sensations. In the successful Rosenthal programme \"Gourmet Collection\" you will find everything that celebrates the authentic blending from the very beginning. Plates, platters and bowls move into a culinary showcase for delicacies from all the world in a blaze of colours. Amazon.com With the Gourmet Collection, the renowned German company Rosenthal puts a sophisticated spin on all-white tableware. Created from premium porcelain with a clear glossy glaze, the pattern blends versatile shapes, pristine coloring, and smart sizing. The result is a handsome backdrop that supports instead of competing with the visual appeal of the food. Designed for restaurant use or the discerning home chef, the collection features dramatic shaping in its accent pieces but sticks to simpler designs for the staples, so practicality is foremost. With its vertical shaping and trim design, the Gourmet Collection cup satisfies tall latté drinkers without straying into a super-size portion. The design flares minimally from the base to the rim for a composed look, and the smart triangular handle adds an understated bit of style. A match for the Gourmet Collection 6-inch saucer, the cup holds 12 ounces and is safe in the dishwasher and microwave. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31STV8NGAZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rosenthal","source_asin":"B000BPQ3IM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805222","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000BPQ3IM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000BPQ3IM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
