window.products.push({"id":805242,"name":"Prefer Green 12PCS Reusable Produce Bags, Premium Zero Waste Mesh Bags for Storage Fruit Vegetables, Eco-Friendly With Colorful Tare Weight on Tags, 3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EW60rLPTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Eco-friendly & Zero Waste Produce Bags: One more step closer to an eco-friendly zero waste lifestyle and cuts plastic bags use in a convenient way;Each mesh produce bag has the potential to eliminate up to 1000 plastic bags over its lifetime. Since our bags are reusable, you just spending a little more up front, will save more money in the long run. Transparent Produce Bags: Prefer Green reusable produce bags are completely transparent for airflow and visibility. They are sheer enough for the barcodes to run through them, enabling you to swiftly pass through checkout with your purchases. No need to waste time double handling your produce when you get home from the market, simply wash the produce in the bag, allow to dry, put away and enjoy an organized fridge. Lightweight & Convenient: Prefer Green reusable mesh bags are made of ultra fine yet strong mesh polyester, the bag is super lightweight that it won't add weight to your produce; Colorful drawstrings and tags help to keep you more organized, they are easy to open and close with drawstring toggle closure; toss several bags into a ball and put it in your purse, so that you always have bags for unplanned shopping. One Size Does Not Fit All: Size and quantity do matter. This set includes a whopping bulk quantity of 12 mesh bags, made up of 3 Small 12x8in, 6 medium or large 12x14in, and 3 extra large 12x17in. From storing produce in the fridge, to keeping a spare set in your trunk, you're covered. Those pesky hard-to-open plastic bags will finally be a thing of the past. Easy to clean & Washable: Wash your fruit and veggies right in Prefer Green zero waste produce bags, let them air dry and then put them straight into the fridge;Being washable is a must for any net zero reusable produce bags, and all Prefer Green reusable mesh bags are Washable! It is best to wash by hand. If you need machine wash, please follow our machine wash instructions,then they are good to go again, no problem!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EW60rLPTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Prefer Green","source_asin":"B07TB2YNXF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805242","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TB2YNXF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TB2YNXF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
