window.products.push({"id":805460,"name":"Beautiful Church Decortive Window Film Privacy Static Cling Stained Glass Window Sticker UV Blocking Heat Control Frosted Window Coverings for Home Of","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H9WTYtNTL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Privacy Window Film Use Steps: Step 01. Keep Window or Glass clean Step 02. Wet the Window or Glass with water(Soapy water will be the best choice) Step 03. Remove from backing protect sheet(which is a kind of clear vinyl, please MAKE SURE remove it before you apply the window film to glass) Step 04. Apply to wet glass and smooth with hands Step 05. Squeegee away water and air bubbles. Seller Tips: 1. Instead of traditional glues and adhesives, the window film is basically applied by static cling. Only with some water, you can enjoy the fun of the easy installation. 2. Fit for smooth surface without any dust or fiber. 3. Do not apply to outside window or window with cracks. 4. More efficient in teamwork, a product of strong light blocker and environmentally friendly. 5. Affix tape on both sides to remove the window film from backing film. *Only Applies on Smooth Glass Surfaces* Key Notice For Frosted Window Film: 1. If you want to remove it, simply peel the window film from any corner. It comes off cleanly without leaving residue 2. When not in use, the film must be replaced and stored on the original backing paper. The side of the film that touched the glass should face the glossy side of the backing paper 3. Our film does not apply to carved, over frosted or irregular glass Frosted Window Film Q&A: Q:How long will this film last for? A:In normal condition, it will last for more than 8 years on the window Q:Why there is bubbles inside? A:Because the water is not cleaned out entirly. After you position the film, please smooth out the film with squeegee, make the air bubbles and water out completely Q:Could this film be used for more than one times? A:Yes, but the stickup side of the film must be completely clean","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H9WTYtNTL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GMB","source_asin":"B08KFD917V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805460","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KFD917V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KFD917V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":805461,"name":"Orchid prime Large Wooden Spoon Soup Table Corner Dinner Mixing Stirring Eating with Long Handled Teak Spatula Wooden Kitchenware Cookware Utensil Woo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wLx3dcwpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description: The wooden spoons are popular. It’s because it come from the Nature.  The feeling of back to nature will be more welcome than using of stainless steel and ceramic material.  These wooden spoon for cooking works great for dining or serving food from enamel saucepans that you won’t want to scratch up Product Features: 1. Soup Spoon Size : 2inch X10inch Each package: 1 pc  2. Natural Material: In the Northeast of Thailand, This area is plenty of golden teak wooden which are natural local resources. These soup spoons is made by golden teak wood from Thailand  3. Design By Nature: Teak Wood Grain varies by years and the grow by the Nature. This wooden spoon has Exquisite Wood Grain Patterns which is individual unique. So, It is valuable Kitchenware. It is so proud of using.  4. Handmade Workmanship: Nowadays, Most of the wooden Kitchenware are made by machine but this long handled wooden spoon is made by hand. So, it will take more time and each spoon is unique.  5. Multifunction: The wooden cooking spoons were designed to be comfortable holding and lightweight for cooking, Mixing, Stirring hot soups, coffee, making fried rice, curries, and other dishes.  The wooden kitchen spoon is the best when using non-stick cookware, will not scratch up your pots and pans.  6. Maintenance: Wash them with warm water and soft sponge to preserve their qualities and dry them by hanging in dry place when not used.  When teak products are exposed to oil and heat, their color normally becomes darker, but they are still perfectly useable Package Includes: Each package: 1 pc  Soup Spoon Size : 2inch X10inch  Package Size : 2inch X10inch X0.75 inch  Remarks : Color of product may be not the same on your monitor. It depends on Proto process setting and monitor color calibrate.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wLx3dcwpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Orchid prime","source_asin":"B07VJXH1WZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805461","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VJXH1WZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VJXH1WZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
