window.products.push({"id":805509,"name":"Amuse- Professional Porcelain Bistro Collection Lungo Mugs- Set of 6-17 oz (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eYFJ3bouL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"One of the best values for a large mug set available in the market: Set of 6 Bone China Porcelain White Mugs- 17 oz. each. 100% Lead and Cadmium-Free. Beautiful and contemporary design. Imagine serving coffee, latte, cappuccino or tea using mugs from famous coffee shops around world. Our mugs are used in thousands of professional coffee shops in Europe and North America. Sturdy High Quality and Large Handle: There’s plenty of room between the handle and cup itself, with the well-shade handle, so comfortable in the hand that makes the tea & coffee taste even better. It is also a great solution for other drinks such as latte, cappuccino, milk, chai, hot chocolate, juices and much more Commercial Durability, Restaurant Quality: Our Mugs are Extremely Durable because they are made from professional grade porcelain new china. Dishwasher, Microwave and Oven Safe. Dimensions (inches)- Top: 3.9, Bottom: 2.2 and Height: 4.3 Our porcelain is harder and more durable than others available in the market, therefore it can sustain heavy usage either at home or commercial establishments such as restaurants, bars, bistros, hotels and multiple business applications. Shipped with Strong Mail Order Boxes. If your mug arrives chipped or damaged, please advise and we will send you a replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eYFJ3bouL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amuse Home","source_asin":"B07T17BRWV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805509","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T17BRWV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T17BRWV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":805510,"name":"Kitchen Rugs and Mat, Elegant Twill Kitchen Floor Mats, 20\"x32\" Grey Kitchen Sink Mats, Non Skid Kitchen Rugs for in Front of Sink, Kitchen, Hallway, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814sO9R5eLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌼ELEGANT TWILL DESIGN: Unique weaving process, tight edging and simplicity color, made these rugs look accent, elegant. And these beautiful kitchen mats will match any season, any decoration style and never go out of style. 🌼GREAT KITCHEN HELPER: Have you ever slipped in a damp or oily kitchen? Do you dropped knives or fragile items in the kitchen? Is kitchen floor soiled by oil, sauces or food particles? Our kitchen floor mats have great water absorption, quick-drying & superb cushioning which can solve these happen during the cooking process. 🌼WIDELY USE & MATCHABLE: Kitchen mats for floor widely used for home decor, in front of sink, bathroom, living room, porch, garage, office. More than just a floor mat! These rugs can easily match your home, add warmth and flavor to your kitchen or any part of your house. TIP: two ideal sizes and colors to choose from: 20\"x32\", 20x47\" for brown & gray. 🌼ANTI-SLIP & ANTI-SKID: With unique point plastic backing and textured bottom design, these rugs have strong grip, can stay in place even in high traffic cooking areas. Perfect kitchen sink mats prevent shifting or slipping, ensure the safety of you and your family to a much greater extent. 🌼WASHABLE RUGS SAVING YOUR TIME: Constructed of high-grade materials, you can trust our durable mats. For simply care, you may shake the carpet or use a vacuum. For a deeper clean, just toss it in the washing machine and dryer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814sO9R5eLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HTHOOOOOME","source_asin":"B0956DLSJW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805510","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0956DLSJW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0956DLSJW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":805511,"name":"Cotton Cloud Natural Beds and Furniture Pioneer Queen Size Futon","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":267.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91KAKQ4ejML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Intended for both couch and bed positions, this handmade futon mattress is a Cotton Cloud original. It is a versatile handcrafted futon that is designed for everyday use. This futon is ideally suited to be used every day as a sofa and the occasional bed. At the center of this approximately 6\" futon is one 2.5\" piece of 1.5 density HR convoluted Certipur Foam, which provides resiliency and support. This core is wrapped in 5\" of natural luxurious cotton batting that is processed locally to our exact standards. All of the materials are protected by a heavy outer shell that features double-stitched seams. Our futons are tufted in order to keep all materials in place. In order to pass flammability tests per Federal Regulations, the cotton we use is treated with a small amount of borax. We can manufacture a mattress without borax, however, that would require a Doctor's note. Message us for more information.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91KAKQ4ejML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cotton Cloud Natural Beds and Furniture","source_asin":"B00LU0B3S2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805511","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LU0B3S2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LU0B3S2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":805512,"name":"Paddywax Library Collection Mark Twain 2-Wick Scented Travel Tin Candle, Set of 2, 3.5-Ounce, Tobacco Flowers & Vanilla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QuvPMjWDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Travel tin candles are not just good for making the hotel room smell better, they are a great size for a small room, a good gift, and nice for your office or den. The Paddywax Library collection pairs favorite quotes with custom blended fragrances designed to evoke the spirit of author for which it is named. Each Paddywax Candle is hand poured in the USA using a vegan soy wax blend and U. S. -sourced cotton wicks. Artfully Crafted - Paddywax is an artisan candle company in Nashville, TN, founded in 1996. Each candle features a soy wax blend hand-poured into an easily repurposed vessel with cotton wicks. Specializing in candles and diffusers that compliment home decor trends, Paddywax candles are made with quality materials, inspiring color palettes, and intriguing fragrances to set the tone in your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QuvPMjWDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Paddywax","source_asin":"B01EHSON5S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805512","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01EHSON5S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01EHSON5S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
