window.products.push({"id":805576,"name":"ColdCan Core Plus Riser, Watch Out Yellow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cwecQH7LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keeps cold drinks colder, longer. ColdCan uses spacesuit insulating technology to lock in the cold. Enjoy 12oz & 16oz can drinks, plus with more accessories to come, you can use ColdCan anytime you want to keep a drink cold...and hot, with future attachments! The perfect workmate - ColdCan keeps your drinks cold while you work and the non-slip + Snap-On lid base means no messes. Close-and-go Travel mode - Load your drink into ColdCan ice cold and go for hours. Then pop it open when you're ready for a refreshing drink. No ice chest needed. Perfect for hiking, biking, picnics, camping, boating, etc. Modular Design - Our modular CryoLok system allows ColdCan parts to lock easily, but firmly together. The ColdCan Core acts as the body of the ColdCan and fits a 12 ounce can. The ColdCan Core locks with the ColdCan Riser, to expand the container to hold most 16 ounce cans. In our pursuit to use the best materials possible, we found Cryogel, a derivative of the same substance (silica aerogel) used as insulation in NASA space suits and the Mars rover. It is the most insulating substance known to man for this type of application. We top all this insulating technology off with a Full LIFETIME WARRANTY. ColdCan wants to be your partner for life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cwecQH7LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ColdCan","source_asin":"B01LXNNQPB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805576","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LXNNQPB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LXNNQPB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
