window.products.push({"id":805586,"name":"Innovative Textile Solutions 849203013581 Reverse Waterproof Loveseat, Burgundy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T475D+oUL._AC_SL1168_.jpg","description":"No longer need to cover your furniture with old sheets or towels. Protect your furniture in style with our reversible waterproof fleece furniture covers. Furniture protectors or slipcovers are an ideal way to protect your furniture from spills and stains. All are reversible to a neutral camel colorway. Finished with a 1\" binding on all sides and a long back flap to help the protector stay in place. Choose the correct size for your furniture by measuring from the inside of right arm to inside of left arm. Drape and cover over your furniture. Locate the three seams (two short seams go between the arms/seat and the long seam should be placed between the seat cushions and back). Slipcover measures 88\" wide (arm to arm) with a depth (front to back) 75.5\". Ideal for loveseats that have a seat width of 46\" left to right and a seat depth of 24\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T475D+oUL._AC_SL1168_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Innovative Textile Solutions","source_asin":"B074JFBRP6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805586","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074JFBRP6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074JFBRP6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
