window.products.push({"id":805616,"name":"KingsBottle 164 Bottle Dual Zone Wine Cooler, Glass Door with Stainless Trim","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mIHNa5WIL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer KingsBottle knows that not all wine can be stored the same way. Different wines need to be served at different temperatures. Rich and full-bodied reds should be served at 59-65F (15-18C); light reds at 53-57F (12-14C); whites and rose at 44-57F (7-14C), and sparkling wines at 43-48F ( 6-9C). With a dual zone wine cellar you no longer have to choose between your favorites. Dual zone wine cellars can accommodate two different serving temperatures. KingsBottle understands the need for different temperatures and the desire for convenience of being able to store them all in one wine cellar. This is why we created our dual zone wine cellars. The advantage of a dual zone wine cellar is that you can store both reds and whites at their ideal temperatures. All of the KingsBottle dual zone wine cellars come with our 100% satisfaction guarantee. We take pride in providing you with the best in refrigerated wine storage. This sleek dual zone model can accommodate 170 of your best bottles. Beautiful as a stand alone unit or as a seamless built in unit, this perfect for your wine storage needs. This model Features blue LED lighting, ball bearing rollers and a fan circulated air cooling system. Backed by our 100% satisfaction guarantee, you can't go wrong.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mIHNa5WIL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KingsBottle","source_asin":"B00AOAHT7I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805616","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AOAHT7I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AOAHT7I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
