window.products.push({"id":805638,"name":"teaposy - Daydream Glass Teapot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yw-kObK8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Handmade borosilicate glass teapot: 24oz or 700ml, makes 3 full cups of tea. Our best-selling teapot! The Daydream teapot's classic curves provide a perfect space for the posy teas to bloom. This teapot has a crystal-like textured handle, adding modern flair to its traditional design. It also has a distinctive lid holder and a stainless steel loose leaf filter at the spout. Not just elegant, but functional as well. Use it for posy teas or any loose or bagged teas. Find FAQs about our glassware here... Or, Watch how I was made in this video!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yw-kObK8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Teaposy","source_asin":"B000XSPGZI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805638","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000XSPGZI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000XSPGZI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":805639,"name":"Jingsense Digital Alarm Clock Radio, AM/FM Radio with Preset, 12/24H, DST, Sleep Timer and Dimmer for Bedroom…","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41fgQoqw0HL._AC_.jpg","description":"Important: The attached wire on the back is work as FM radio antenna, pls don’t cut it off.  Nowadays, people still use alarm clocks for bedrooms, nightstands, bedside or tables and desks, but what actually most people purchase alarm clock for? Just to wake up, know the time and listen to news and music while sleep and get up. That is what our digital alarm clock radio intends to do. In a word, this is not only a digital alarm clock but also an AM-FM radio for bedside.  This alarm clock is designed to be the simplest bedside alarm clock radio for your needs. With the clearly labeled buttons on the top and you will easily know how to operate this clock. The small 0.6 inches LED digits are bright and clear to see from across the room, and the digits can be dimmed during the night so it doesn’t disturb sleep. The alarm has two sounds-radio/buzzer for your choice, and you can get that extra 9 minutes of sleep before getting up with the snooze function. While you feel free, turn on AM or FM radio to get news, music, ball games, enjoy rest time in a healthy way.  In case of power failure, the battery backup will take over and time and alarm settings will be maintained. The LED display will go blank to conserve battery power. This digital clock radio is ourlet powered, need to plug into wall outlet to light up display to use alarm clock, radio, snooze and sleeper function.  We add some practical functions for daily use- DST, 12/24H and PRESET, you can set the time format and daylight saving time easily. The PRESET function could auto-search and save all stations, easy to find the station you want next time.  If what you are looking for is a Small & Basic & Easy alarm clock radio with digital LED display, this is exactly it! Plus, 90-days money back and one year warranty would be provided to this bedroom alarm clock radio. Give it a try, add to your cart today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41fgQoqw0HL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jingsense","source_asin":"B09KXSMVHH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805639","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KXSMVHH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KXSMVHH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
