window.products.push({"id":805662,"name":"Yoursme DIY Rapid Tongs Bundle Set - Blacksmith Five types of Tongs Bundle Set Comes with Rivet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GrFbPlVbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Rapid Tongs Bundle contains five types of tongs that are essential in almost every shop. Feature: √ Made out of 5/16\" mild steel, making the tongs lighter and easier to handle when working with smaller stock sizes. √ You have to drill or punch. Heat and hit them to get it right. But it's not difficult. Package Included: 1 Rapid Bolt Tongs1 Rapid Flat Jaw Tongs1 Rapid Slot Jaw Tongs1 Rapid V-Bit Tongs1 Rapid Scroll Tongs (each pair of tongs comes with a rivet) User's Guide below for full instructions - Rapid Bolt Tongs: It has an open jaw which makes them ideal for grabbing metal with a bulky end that would get in the way with other styles of tongs.The jaws are 3\" long x 1-3/4\" wide and the reins are 13-1/4\" long. - Rapid Flat Jaw Tongs: The most popular and versatile tongs. They are great for almost any project and can be shaped intobox jaw, wolf jaw, or v-bit tongs to hold various sizes of metal. The jaws are 1-1/2\" long x 1\" wide and the reins are 11-1/2\" long. - Rapid Slot Jaw Tongs: The addition of the slot in the jaw of these tongs allows you to grab round, square, or flat iron with the same pair of tongs.The jaws are 1-1/2\" long x 1\" wide and the reins are 11-1/2\" long. - Rapid V-Bit Tongs: It is made to fit multiple sizes and shapes of material. The \"v\" gives you a better grip on the material.It is made from 5/16\" thick mild steel. The jaws are 2-1/2\" long x 1\" wide and the reins are 12\" long. - Rapid Scroll Tongs: It is smaller with a tapered jaw, which is generally used in scrolling or detail work.The size also makes it versatile for many other applications. The jaws are 1-5/8\" long and the reins are 6-3/8\" long. If you have any problems for installation, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GrFbPlVbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yoursme","source_asin":"B07TLB9Q9H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805662","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TLB9Q9H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TLB9Q9H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
