window.products.push({"id":805684,"name":"Automatic Soap Dispenser, Iorbur Wall Mounted Foaming Soap Dispenser, 320ml Rechargeable & IPX 4 Waterproof Hand Sanitizer Dispenser, Touch-Free Dispe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51D-5RFQM5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧼【Easily & Widely Used】- This wall-mounted soap dispenser has a built-in sensitive intelligent infrared sensor. There is 3-level soap amount control: double-click the button to enter into shifting mode and the display shows the current gear (display flashes), press once within 2s can change to another gear. 001 - foaming in 1s, 002 - foaming in 1.5s, 003 - foaming in 2s. Automatically quit the setting without pressing within 2s. 🧼【Large Capacity & Upgraded Digital Display】- The soap dispenser is with a 320ml/10.82oz big capacity and replaceable tank. And it is compatible with most kinds of foaming-type hand sanitizer. This foaming soap dispenser built-in a high-sensitivity temperature sensor to perceive the environmental temperature changes which are making your life more comfortable. Please note the temperature shown on the display is the indoor temperature, not the outdoor temperature. 🧼【Convenient Wall Mount Design】- Hole-free wall-mounted design, simple and compact, not taking up any spaces. Our sensor soap dispenser features a mini compact and simple design, it can be easily integrated into various environments such as bathrooms and kitchens. (Note: Please stick the wall-mounted on the wall for 24 hours before hanging up the soap dispenser.) 🧼【Rechargeable & IPX 4 Waterproof】- The wall-mounted automatic soap dispenser is powered by rechargeable batteries, which increases the power density. Efficient and durable that will last for years. This IPX 4 waterproof touch-free dispenser is a great choice for the bathroom and kitchen. 🧼【Your Ideal Choice】- This automatic foaming soap dispenser is made of high-quality premium ABS, with good impact resistance and corrosion resistance, which can ensure the long-term use of the soap dispenser. The touch-less soap dispenser with a motion sensor provides you with a sanitary and easy-to-use experience, without excessive spillages. Note: Put your hand under the sensor at a position of 5-7cm/1.97in - 2.76in. 🧼【Reliable Support Service】- It is our pleasure to offer you our full presence and best support - If you have any questions about our product. You can contact our customer service, we will reply within 24 hours. And we will provide a replacement and money-back.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51D-5RFQM5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Iorbur","source_asin":"B09PH1PGH6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805684","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PH1PGH6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PH1PGH6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
