window.products.push({"id":805728,"name":"Brizled Color Changing Christmas Lights, 33ft 100 LED 4th of July Lights with Remote, Dimmable Outdoor Christmas Lights String, USB Christmas Tree Lig","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817oMkjfflL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Various Colors and Modes for Options: 16 single colors + kinds of combined colors, steady on and flash are available, these RGB string lights allow you to set up the correct color and lighting modes according to your desire. One lights string provides year-round special holidays' essential colors. Such as all colors for Christmas; red white & blue for July 4th; orange/purple for Halloween; orange for Thanksgiving; green for St Patrick's Day; red/pink/purple for Valentine's Day. Adjustable Speed & Brightness: 4 Levels to adjust lights brightness, bright, soft & dim. 4 Levels of speed to adjust dynamic mode. Brizled RGB string lights with a 40-keys remote, you can handy-free to create a unique atmosphere for weddings, parties, rooms, Christmas, Halloween, Thanksgiving, July 4th, St Patrick's Day, Valentine's Day and Easter diverse various occasions according to your needs. Dim the lights for bedtime or speed it up for a party, it's totally all up to you! Safety USB Powered & Multifunctional Remote: 2 ways for lighting mode control: Via the control button on the USB, or via a 40-keys remote controller, convenient and flexible mode changing. USB powered, low voltage, ensure safety use. Multifunctional remote, you can set up the right color with the corresponding mode, set timing, adjust brightness or speed, etc. Handy operation with the remote, no need to worry about the string lights installed too tall and difficult to control. Waterproof Sting Lights: These remote control color-changing string lights are IP44 water-resistant and work well even in rainy days, perfect for indoor and outdoor decorations.【NOTE】 When using outdoor, please kindly protect the power adapter and electric transformer from the water! Memory Function & Timer Options: The color-changing string lights have a memory function, no need to repeat settings. Set\"4H\"&\"6H\"& “8H” by remote, and the Christmas string lights will be automatically on for 4/6/8 hours and off for 20/18/16 hours per day. Why These String Lights Would Be your Best Choice: Compare with other RGB string lights, Brizled 40-key remote multifunctional led string lights provide kinds of combined colors. In addition, feature a pause or play button, you can pause and select the current flash way and color as your desire, giving you a whole host of different light flashing options. Pause functions will work for the 9 functions auto cycle mode(each function with kinds of single or combined colors) in any color and mode.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817oMkjfflL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brizled","source_asin":"B0BPSXTRH8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805728","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPSXTRH8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPSXTRH8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
