window.products.push({"id":805741,"name":"Air Fryer Silicone Pot, 3-Piece 8-inch Reusable Thickened Silica Gel Square Air Fryer Inner Liner Tray Baking Tray Silicone Basket Liners ((black+blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.68,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711KToV4WYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Practical Design】The air fryer silicone pot are designed with more than ten soft silica gel straight lines, which can improve the air circulation and heat distribution. At the same time, the oil in the meat can flow into the deep groove at the bottom, so that you can enjoy the food without any burden. The handles are designed on both sides of the silica air fryer silica liner, which makes it easier to take out the food when taking out the air fryer silica gel liner. 【Food Grade Material】Silicone air fryer silica gel liner is made of 0.05inch thickened food grade silica gel, which is non sticky and can withstand high temperature up to 464 ℉ (240 ℃), It will not affect the taste of the food and ensure the original taste of the food itself. Air fryer accessories can be turned over for easy cleaning, and can be hung for storage after washing and drying to save space. 【Applicable Size】Normal opening diameter of silicone air fryer silica gel liner: 8inch, bottom diameter: 7 inch, height: 2inch (excluding handle). Suitable for baking pans 7.9 inches and above. (Please confirm whether it is applicable to your frying pan before purchase) 【Ideal Choice】Are you still confused that the lining of round air fryer is not suitable for your square air fryer? The square air fryer has a special air fryer silica gel liner. Our reusable square air fryer silicone paper liner helps solve this problem in a very cool way! 【Wide Application】Our air air fryer basket can be used for baking, baking, frying or containing food, and are suitable for air fryers, microwave ovens, cake plates, cooking utensils, steamers and ovens, etc. It is very suitable for home baking, camping, barbecue, summer parties and other occasions","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711KToV4WYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tefola","source_asin":"B0BVM4NNQY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805741","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVM4NNQY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVM4NNQY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
