window.products.push({"id":805812,"name":"WATSABRO Kitchen Blow Torch,Culinary Butane Torch Lighters Refillable Double Fire Cooking Torch,Mini Adjustable Flame Butane Lighters for Dabs,Creme B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nvDeZ43lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Safety】:The torch lighters butane features a durable aluminum alloy metal body and non-slip handle, and the compact safety lock effectively prevents improper operation and accidental ignition.When not in use, please adjust the flame level to the minimum. If the switch on the other side is locked in the \"off\" position at the same time, the gas can be stored safely. 【Convenient Portability】: This butane torch is light and easy to carry (L: 3.34 inch, H: 5.1inch), suitable for picnics, gatherings, parties and other occasions. It's fully functional, the blow torch with an adjustable flame size button and can reach up to 1300°C/2370°F! When adjusted to the “Lock” switch, the kitchen torch can Keep burning all the way. 【Double Flame Design】: The torch lighters has been designed with double flame.After testing, we found that dual flames have a shorter heating time and more uniform heating than single flames. Of course, you can also switch between double flame or single flame by turning the button (clockwise rotation: single flame; counterclockwise rotation: double flame) 【Reusable】: The cooking torch can be used with any brand of long-nozzle butane gas cylinders. When the gas is almost exhausted, follow the procedure shown in the picture to refill the butane torch lighters, then it can be recycled (Note: there will be no leakage of white gas in normal filling, if white gas appears, it proves that the culinary torch is full). 【Best gift】: The torch lighters butane offers an even flame that lights quickly and is fully functional, and its unique styling makes it one of your gift-giving choices.Whether you are celebrating the marriage of close friends, or welcoming a family member to their new home,The food torch is sure to be a memorable and appreciated gift for many meals to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nvDeZ43lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATSABRO","source_asin":"B08LBKHLVW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805812","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LBKHLVW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LBKHLVW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
