window.products.push({"id":805927,"name":"Redecker Pastry Brushes Set with Untreated Beechwood Handles, 4 Different Sizes, Multi-purpose Brushes with Natural Boar Bristles for Basting, Glazing","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81crJ7PP0HS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A set of 4 pastry brushes for all your cooking and baking needs Ideal for glazing, basting, spreading sauces, icing pastries or cakes, making candy and greasing pans with oil or melted butter, the Redecker Pastry Brushes with Untreated Beechwood Handles is a highly-versatile kitchen tool set. Soft and flexible natural boar bristles properly absorb liquids for easy application and promote smooth and effortless spreading. Great for applying egg washes, sugar glazes and flavorful spice mixes to fish, meat, pastries, cakes and other baked goods. Easy-to-grip handle made from beautiful handcrafted beechwood with a steel joint between the handle and bristle for durability and lasting quality. The wood is untreated and color will vary somewhat from product image due to natural variations in the wood. Comes with four pastry brushes ideal for a wide range of cooking and baking tasks. Includes four (4) pastry brushes sized 3/4” x 7-1/2”, 1” x 8\", 1-1/2” x 8-1/4”, and 2” x 8-1/2\" . To clean, handwash then gently dry with a cotton towel. Not safe for dishwasher. The first handcrafted Bürstenhaus Redecker brushes were produced in 1935. A lot has changed since then. Today, the name Bürstenhaus Redecker stands as it has for many years for an ideal combination of natural quality, function and design. It lives from the blend of inventiveness, sound craftsmanship and creativity. Handcrafted in Germany, Bürstenhaus Redecker brushes are made of domestic woods, bristles, hair, and plant fibers, and have been for decades. Precedence is given to natural, sustainable raw materials.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81crJ7PP0HS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"REDECKER","source_asin":"B096G8DGXM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805927","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096G8DGXM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096G8DGXM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
