window.products.push({"id":805940,"name":"iLIDS Mason Jar Storage Lid, Wide Mouth, Purple, Pack of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713DVDiIqIL._AC_SL1492_.jpg","description":"The one-piece storage lid makes it possible to shake up your smoothie or have airtight storage of dry goods right in your mason jar. You want to drink \"au natural\" - straight from your mason jar - but need a cover for travel or just to keep your drink fresh in the fridge. Use small 4 ounce jars with iLIDS to keep your spices airtight. iLIDS on pint size jars keep nuts and seeds fresh. We think the regular size opening on the mason jar makes large jars easier to pour from. So make your iced tea, lemonade or fresh juice in your favorite regular mouth jar and store it in the refrigerator covered with a regular storage lid. Store your soup in a large jar with an iLID. It takes a lot less room in your refrigerator than a soup pot! have you figured out that the regular mouth quart mason jar is the one that fits most standard countertop blenders? make your smoothie or shake in the mason jar, cover with the blender's blade apparatus and blend away. Then remove the blade and replace with a drink or storage iLID and you're on your way. If you're new to the idea that the mason jar fits on a blender, do a quick search on YouTube.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713DVDiIqIL._AC_SL1492_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iLIDS","source_asin":"B00P1702XC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-805940","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00P1702XC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00P1702XC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
